      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795510689960,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. GET /api/converation/messages/:conversationId\n\n Only user who are linked to the onversation through conversation\n member model can only view the conversation messages \n\n This api provides the list of messages in the conversation in proper\n sequence following the idea of pagination or scroll based calls to \n avoid load on both frontend and backend server\n\n2. GET /api/conversation/group\n\n Only for authenticated user\n\n User who request this should be given with all the \"group\" type \n conversations they have\n\n3. GET /api/conversation/direct \n\n Only for authenticated user\n \n User who request this should be given with all the \"direct\" type \n conversations they have\n\n4. GET /api/conversation/all\n\n Only for authenticated user\n\n User who request this should be given with all the conversations\n he/she is linked to",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. GET /api/converation/messages/:conversationId\n\n Only user who are linked to the onversation through conversation\n member model can only view the conversation messages \n\n This api provides the list of messages in the conversation in proper\n sequence following the idea of pagination or scroll based calls to \n avoid load on both frontend and backend server\n\n2. GET /api/conversation/group\n\n Only for authenticated user\n\n User who request this should be given with all the \"group\" type \n conversations they have\n\n3. GET /api/conversation/direct \n\n Only for authenticated user\n \n User who request this should be given with all the \"direct\" type \n conversations they have\n\n4. GET /api/conversation/all\n\n Only for authenticated user\n\n User who request this should be given with all the conversations\n he/she is linked to",
